WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.000
On your phone, it works the same way.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Tap the menu at the top right. Sign in is at the bottom.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Continue with Google, or type your email and password.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Tap Sign in, and the admin opens.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.000
The menu button at the top left opens the whole admin menu.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:26.000
And the bar along the bottom has four shortcuts: Overview, Needs attention, Brand check and Brands.
